{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 829,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I would like\nto start with testicles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6663,
    "dDurationMs": 1625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Laughter)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9204,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Men who sleep five hours a night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11954,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have significantly smaller testicles\nthan those who sleep seven hours or more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17246,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Laughter)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20079,
    "dDurationMs": 5084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In addition, men who routinely sleep\njust four to five hours a night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25163,
    "dDurationMs": 2541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will have a level of testosterone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27704,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is that of someone\n10 years their senior."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33079,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a lack of sleep\nwill age a man by a decade"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36871,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in terms of that critical\naspect of wellness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41954,
    "dDurationMs": 4417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we see equivalent impairments\nin female reproductive health"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46371,
    "dDurationMs": 1416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "caused by a lack of sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51079,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the best news\nthat I have for you today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53746,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Laughter)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56454,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From this point, it may only get worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58871,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only will I tell you\nabout the wonderfully good things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61662,
    "dDurationMs": 1834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that happen when you get sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63537,
    "dDurationMs": 4459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the alarmingly bad things\nthat happen when you don't get enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68038,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both for your brain and for your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71371,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me start with the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73829,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the functions of learning and memory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76871,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because what we've discovered\nover the past 10 or so years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80163,
    "dDurationMs": 2875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that you need sleep after learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83079,
    "dDurationMs": 3292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to essentially hit the save button\non those new memories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86371,
    "dDurationMs": 1292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that you don't forget."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88954,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But recently, we discovered\nthat you also need sleep before learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94496,
    "dDurationMs": 3042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to actually prepare your brain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97579,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost like a dry sponge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99663,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ready to initially soak up\nnew information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103163,
    "dDurationMs": 3125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And without sleep,\nthe memory circuits of the brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106288,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "essentially become\nwaterlogged, as it were,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109079,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can't absorb new memories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112163,
    "dDurationMs": 1916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me show you the data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114079,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here in this study, we decided\nto test the hypothesis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118371,
    "dDurationMs": 2542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that pulling the all-nighter\nwas a good idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122246,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we took a group of individuals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124621,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we assigned them\nto one of two experimental groups:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128204,
    "dDurationMs": 3459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sleep group\nand a sleep deprivation group."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131663,
    "dDurationMs": 4625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the sleep group, they're going to get\na full eight hours of slumber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136329,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the deprivation group,\nwe're going to keep them awake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138996,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the laboratory, under full supervision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141663,
    "dDurationMs": 4375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no naps or caffeine, by the way,\nso it's miserable for everyone involved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146579,
    "dDurationMs": 1542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the next day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148121,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're going to place those participants\ninside an MRI scanner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152454,
    "dDurationMs": 3792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're going to have them\ntry and learn a whole list of new facts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156288,
    "dDurationMs": 3291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we're taking snapshots\nof brain activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159579,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we're going to test them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161579,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see how effective\nthat learning has been."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164954,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what you're looking at\nhere on the vertical axis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168496,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you put\nthose two groups head to head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171204,
    "dDurationMs": 5042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what you find is a quite significant,\n40-percent deficit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176288,
    "dDurationMs": 3458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the ability of the brain\nto make new memories without sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181038,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this should be concerning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182913,
    "dDurationMs": 2208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "considering what we know\nis happening to sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185163,
    "dDurationMs": 2416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in our education populations right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188538,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, to put that in context,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190371,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would be the difference\nin a child acing an exam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193913,
    "dDurationMs": 2875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "versus failing it miserably -- 40 percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198288,
    "dDurationMs": 4208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we've gone on to discover\nwhat goes wrong within your brain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202496,
    "dDurationMs": 3125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to produce these types\nof learning disabilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206746,
    "dDurationMs": 1583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's a structure that sits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208371,
    "dDurationMs": 4625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the left and the right side\nof your brain, called the hippocampus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212996,
    "dDurationMs": 1792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can think of the hippocampus"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214829,
    "dDurationMs": 3209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost like the informational\ninbox of your brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218621,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very good at receiving\nnew memory files"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221829,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then holding on to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224913,
    "dDurationMs": 1708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when you look at this structure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226663,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in those people who'd had\na full night of sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229746,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we saw lots of healthy\nlearning-related activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234621,
    "dDurationMs": 2958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet in those people\nwho were sleep-deprived,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237621,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we actually couldn't find\nany significant signal whatsoever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242746,
    "dDurationMs": 4958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's almost as though sleep deprivation\nhad shut down your memory inbox,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247746,
    "dDurationMs": 2958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and any new incoming files --\nthey were just being bounced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251913,
    "dDurationMs": 3583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You couldn't effectively\ncommit new experiences to memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258038,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's the bad that can happen\nif I were to take sleep away from you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262579,
    "dDurationMs": 3084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but let me just come back\nto that control group for a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266454,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember those folks\nthat got a full eight hours of sleep?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270413,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we can ask\na very different question:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272913,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it about the physiological\nquality of your sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276538,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you do get it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278121,
    "dDurationMs": 3792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that restores and enhances\nyour memory and learning ability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281954,
    "dDurationMs": 1125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each and every day?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283996,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by placing electrodes\nall over the head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286996,
    "dDurationMs": 4042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we've discovered\nis that there are big, powerful brainwaves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291079,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that happen during\nthe very deepest stages of sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294704,
    "dDurationMs": 2292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have riding on top of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297038,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these spectacular bursts\nof electrical activity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300329,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we call sleep spindles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303079,
    "dDurationMs": 4417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's the combined quality\nof these deep-sleep brainwaves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307496,
    "dDurationMs": 4458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that acts like a file-transfer\nmechanism at night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311996,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shifting memories from a short-term\nvulnerable reservoir"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316079,
    "dDurationMs": 4334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a more permanent long-term\nstorage site within the brain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320454,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore protecting them,\nmaking them safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325454,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is important that we understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327538,
    "dDurationMs": 5041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what during sleep actually transacts\nthese memory benefits,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332621,
    "dDurationMs": 4125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there are real medical\nand societal implications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336788,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let me just tell you about one area"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338788,
    "dDurationMs": 3458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we've moved this work\nout into, clinically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342288,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the context of aging\nand dementia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346871,
    "dDurationMs": 3417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's of course no secret\nthat, as we get older,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350329,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our learning and memory abilities\nbegin to fade and decline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355038,
    "dDurationMs": 1625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what we've also discovered"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356704,
    "dDurationMs": 6750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that a physiological signature of aging\nis that your sleep gets worse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363496,
    "dDurationMs": 3792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially that deep quality of sleep\nthat I was just discussing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368621,
    "dDurationMs": 3125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And only last year,\nwe finally published evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371746,
    "dDurationMs": 2958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that these two things,\nthey're not simply co-occurring,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374746,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are significantly interrelated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378829,
    "dDurationMs": 3292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it suggests\nthat the disruption of deep sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382163,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is an underappreciated factor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384454,
    "dDurationMs": 3917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is contributing\nto cognitive decline or memory decline"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388413,
    "dDurationMs": 3583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in aging, and most recently\nwe've discovered,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391996,
    "dDurationMs": 2208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Alzheimer's disease as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396329,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I know this is remarkably\ndepressing news."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400079,
    "dDurationMs": 2292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's in the mail. It's coming at you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402413,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's a potential\nsilver lining here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405746,
    "dDurationMs": 4875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unlike many of the other factors\nthat we know are associated with aging,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410621,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example changes\nin the physical structure of the brain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414329,
    "dDurationMs": 3042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's fiendishly difficult to treat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417413,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that sleep is a missing piece\nin the explanatory puzzle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421996,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of aging and Alzheimer's is exciting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424621,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we may be able\nto do something about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428538,
    "dDurationMs": 3916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one way that we are\napproaching this at my sleep center"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432496,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not by using\nsleeping pills, by the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435496,
    "dDurationMs": 4958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfortunately, they are blunt instruments\nthat do not produce naturalistic sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441538,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, we're actually developing\na method based on this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444788,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's called direct current\nbrain stimulation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448038,
    "dDurationMs": 3291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You insert a small amount\nof voltage into the brain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451329,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so small you typically don't feel it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453621,
    "dDurationMs": 1875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it has a measurable impact."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456829,
    "dDurationMs": 6334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you apply this stimulation\nduring sleep in young, healthy adults,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463204,
    "dDurationMs": 4709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as if you're sort of singing in time\nwith those deep-sleep brainwaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467913,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not only can you amplify\nthe size of those deep-sleep brainwaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472496,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in doing so, we can almost\ndouble the amount of memory benefit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477079,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you get from sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479121,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The question now\nis whether we can translate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481954,
    "dDurationMs": 4292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this same affordable,\npotentially portable piece of technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486288,
    "dDurationMs": 2875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into older adults and those with dementia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490704,
    "dDurationMs": 4584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we restore back\nsome healthy quality of deep sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495329,
    "dDurationMs": 4625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in doing so, can we salvage\naspects of their learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499954,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and memory function?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501496,
    "dDurationMs": 2167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is my real hope now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504371,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's one of our moon-shot\ngoals, as it were."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509329,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's an example\nof sleep for your brain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512704,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but sleep is just\nas essential for your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517287,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've already spoken about sleep loss\nand your reproductive system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521871,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or I could tell you about sleep loss\nand your cardiovascular system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526746,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that all it takes is one hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529954,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because there is a global experiment\nperformed on 1.6 billion people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535454,
    "dDurationMs": 4292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across 70 countries twice a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539787,
    "dDurationMs": 1875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's called daylight saving time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542912,
    "dDurationMs": 3459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, in the spring,\nwhen we lose one hour of sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546371,
    "dDurationMs": 5625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we see a subsequent 24-percent increase\nin heart attacks that following day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554954,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the autumn,\nwhen we gain an hour of sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558162,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we see a 21-percent\nreduction in heart attacks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563746,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that incredible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566912,
    "dDurationMs": 5709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you see exactly the same profile\nfor car crashes, road traffic accidents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572621,
    "dDurationMs": 1916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even suicide rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576912,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as a deeper dive,\nI want to focus on this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579871,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sleep loss and your immune system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583162,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here, I'll introduce these delightful\nblue elements in the image."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587996,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are called natural killer cells,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591204,
    "dDurationMs": 4875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can think of natural killer cells\nalmost like the secret service agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596079,
    "dDurationMs": 1625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your immune system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597704,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are very good at identifying\ndangerous, unwanted elements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602746,
    "dDurationMs": 1375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eliminating them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605246,
    "dDurationMs": 3958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, what they're doing here\nis destroying a cancerous tumor mass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610579,
    "dDurationMs": 5958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what you wish for\nis a virile set of these immune assassins"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616537,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at all times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618621,
    "dDurationMs": 3791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and tragically, that's what you don't have\nif you're not sleeping enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623829,
    "dDurationMs": 1625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here in this experiment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625496,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're not going to have your sleep\ndeprived for an entire night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629329,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're simply going to have your sleep\nrestricted to four hours"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632871,
    "dDurationMs": 1791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one single night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634662,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we're going to look to see\nwhat's the percent reduction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637704,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in immune cell activity that you suffer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640787,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's not small -- it's not 10 percent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643621,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not 20 percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645662,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a 70-percent drop\nin natural killer cell activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651787,
    "dDurationMs": 4042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a concerning state\nof immune deficiency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657371,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can perhaps understand\nwhy we're now finding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660204,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significant links between\nshort sleep duration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664079,
    "dDurationMs": 3917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your risk for the development\nof numerous forms of cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669871,
    "dDurationMs": 2791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Currently, that list includes\ncancer of the bowel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672704,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cancer of the prostate\nand cancer of the breast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677829,
    "dDurationMs": 5375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the link between a lack of sleep\nand cancer is now so strong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683246,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the World Health Organization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685621,
    "dDurationMs": 4208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has classified any form\nof nighttime shift work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689829,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a probable carcinogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693037,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because of a disruption\nof your sleep-wake rhythms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697829,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you may have heard of that old maxim"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700579,
    "dDurationMs": 2125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you can sleep when you're dead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702704,
    "dDurationMs": 2083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I'm being quite serious now --"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704829,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is mortally unwise advice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708371,
    "dDurationMs": 5041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We know this from epidemiological studies\nacross millions of individuals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713412,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a simple truth:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715454,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the shorter your sleep,\nthe shorter your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718871,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Short sleep predicts all-cause mortality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724954,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if increasing your risk\nfor the development of cancer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729121,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even Alzheimer's disease"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731412,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were not sufficiently disquieting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735579,
    "dDurationMs": 3708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have since discovered\nthat a lack of sleep will even erode"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739329,
    "dDurationMs": 4083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the very fabric of biological life itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744662,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your DNA genetic code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748037,
    "dDurationMs": 3917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here in this study,\nthey took a group of healthy adults"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751996,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they limited them\nto six hours of sleep a night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755746,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one week,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757412,
    "dDurationMs": 3834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they measured the change\nin their gene activity profile"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761246,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relative to when those same individuals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763704,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were getting a full eight hours\nof sleep a night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767454,
    "dDurationMs": 1792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there were two critical findings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770204,
    "dDurationMs": 5083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, a sizable and significant 711 genes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775287,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were distorted in their activity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777662,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "caused by a lack of sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779912,
    "dDurationMs": 3125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second result\nwas that about half of those genes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783079,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were actually increased in their activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785829,
    "dDurationMs": 1958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other half were decreased."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788454,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now those genes that were switched off\nby a lack of sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791746,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were genes associated\nwith your immune system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795246,
    "dDurationMs": 2875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so once again, you can see\nthat immune deficiency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799329,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In contrast, those genes\nthat were actually upregulated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802454,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or increased by way of a lack of sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804829,
    "dDurationMs": 3917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were genes associated\nwith the promotion of tumors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808746,
    "dDurationMs": 5166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "genes associated with long-term\nchronic inflammation within the body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813954,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and genes associated with stress,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816746,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, as a consequence,\ncardiovascular disease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821162,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is simply no aspect of your wellness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824871,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can retreat at the sign\nof sleep deprivation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828162,
    "dDurationMs": 1792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and get away unscathed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830912,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's rather like a broken\nwater pipe in your home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833954,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sleep loss will leak down\ninto every nook and cranny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837621,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your physiology,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840037,
    "dDurationMs": 3875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even tampering with\nthe very DNA nucleic alphabet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843954,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that spells out\nyour daily health narrative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849871,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at this point, you may be thinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852579,
    "dDurationMs": 2542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Oh my goodness,\nhow do I start to get better sleep?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855121,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are you tips for good sleep?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858079,
    "dDurationMs": 4458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, beyond avoiding\nthe damaging and harmful impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862579,
    "dDurationMs": 2917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of alcohol and caffeine on sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865537,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you're struggling\nwith sleep at night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867996,
    "dDurationMs": 2166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "avoiding naps during the day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870204,
    "dDurationMs": 2125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have two pieces of advice for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873079,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first is regularity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875954,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go to bed at the same time,\nwake up at the same time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879371,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no matter whether\nit's the weekday or the weekend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882454,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Regularity is king,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885204,
    "dDurationMs": 1958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it will anchor your sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887204,
    "dDurationMs": 3292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and improve the quantity\nand the quality of that sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892371,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second is keep it cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896079,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your body needs to drop\nits core temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898537,
    "dDurationMs": 4209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by about two to three degrees\nFahrenheit to initiate sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902787,
    "dDurationMs": 2084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then to stay asleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904871,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's the reason\nyou will always find it easier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907412,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to fall asleep in a room that's too cold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909787,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than too hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911996,
    "dDurationMs": 3541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So aim for a bedroom temperature\nof around 65 degrees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915537,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or about 18 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917537,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's going to be optimal\nfor the sleep of most people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922454,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then finally,\nin taking a step back, then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925954,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what is the mission-critical\nstatement here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930787,
    "dDurationMs": 2209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I think it may be this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932996,
    "dDurationMs": 5291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sleep, unfortunately,\nis not an optional lifestyle luxury."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939121,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sleep is a nonnegotiable\nbiological necessity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944871,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is your life-support system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948496,
    "dDurationMs": 4625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is Mother Nature's\nbest effort yet at immortality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954704,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the decimation of sleep\nthroughout industrialized nations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959246,
    "dDurationMs": 5208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is having a catastrophic impact\non our health, our wellness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964496,
    "dDurationMs": 2666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even the safety and the education\nof our children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968329,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a silent sleep loss epidemic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971371,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's fast becoming one of the greatest\npublic health challenges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974746,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we face in the 21st century."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980287,
    "dDurationMs": 5084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I believe it is now time for us\nto reclaim our right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985412,
    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a full night of sleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987996,
    "dDurationMs": 2166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and without embarrassment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990204,
    "dDurationMs": 3375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or that unfortunate stigma of laziness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994621,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in doing so, we can be reunited\nwith the most powerful elixir of life,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002037,
    "dDurationMs": 2709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Swiss Army knife\nof health, as it were."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006662,
    "dDurationMs": 2625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that soapbox rant over,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009329,
    "dDurationMs": 2083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will simply say, good night, good luck,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011454,
    "dDurationMs": 1125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and above all ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014871,
    "dDurationMs": 1791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do hope you sleep well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016662,
    "dDurationMs": 1375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much indeed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018037,
    "dDurationMs": 4542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Applause)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022621,
    "dDurationMs": 1125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023787,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Applause)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026663,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you so much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028204,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "David Biello: No, no, no.\nStay there for a second."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030996,
    "dDurationMs": 2542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good job not running away, though.\nI appreciate that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033579,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that was terrifying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034829,
    "dDurationMs": 3084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Matt Walker: You're welcome.\nDB: Yes, thank you, thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038329,
    "dDurationMs": 5167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since we can't catch up on sleep,\nwhat are we supposed to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043496,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do we do when we're, like,\ntossing and turning in bed late at night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047079,
    "dDurationMs": 3042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or doing shift work or whatever else?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050163,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MW: So you're right,\nwe can't catch up on sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052538,
    "dDurationMs": 1291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sleep is not like the bank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053871,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't accumulate a debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055913,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then hope to pay it off\nat a later point in time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058663,
    "dDurationMs": 3125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should also note the reason\nthat it's so catastrophic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061829,
    "dDurationMs": 3042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that our health\ndeteriorates so quickly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064913,
    "dDurationMs": 2708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first, it's because human beings\nare the only species"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067663,
    "dDurationMs": 2458,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that deliberately deprive\nthemselves of sleep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070163,
    "dDurationMs": 2375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for no apparent reason."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072579,
    "dDurationMs": 1125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DB: Because we're smart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073746,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MW: And I make that point\nbecause it means that Mother Nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078579,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "throughout the course of evolution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080288,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has never had to face the challenge\nof this thing called sleep deprivation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085288,
    "dDurationMs": 3416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she's never developed a safety net,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088746,
    "dDurationMs": 2125,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why when you undersleep,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090871,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things just sort of implode so quickly,\nboth within the brain and the body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095246,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you just have to prioritize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098038,
    "dDurationMs": 3291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DB: OK, but tossing and turning in bed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101371,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what do I do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102788,
    "dDurationMs": 4625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MW: So if you are staying in bed\nawake for too long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107454,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should get out of bed\nand go to a different room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110704,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and do something different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112038,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason is because your brain\nwill very quickly associate your bedroom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116413,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the place of wakefulness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118746,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you need to break that association."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121454,
    "dDurationMs": 2875,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So only return to bed when you are sleepy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124371,
    "dDurationMs": 3542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that way you will relearn\nthe association that you once had,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1127954,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is your bed is the place of sleep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130454,
    "dDurationMs": 1667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the analogy would be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132163,
    "dDurationMs": 3583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'd never sit at the dinner table,\nwaiting to get hungry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135746,
    "dDurationMs": 2958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so why would you lie in bed,\nwaiting to get sleepy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139538,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "DB: Well, thank you for that wake-up call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141579,
    "dDurationMs": 1167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great job, Matt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142746,
    "dDurationMs": 2208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "MW: You're very welcome.\nThank you very much."
    } ]
  } ]
}
